WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.300
A snowy day.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.300
Look! A hungry llama.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.300
Oh! The ice is slippery.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.300
A penguin sees a red berry.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:32.300
Here comes a train!

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:43.300
Where is the berry?

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:51.300
The penguin has the berry.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:01.300
Look! What is down there?

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:13.300
A basket full of berries!

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:23.300
Can we share?

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:32.300
The little penguin runs away.

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:41.300
The llama follows the penguin.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:51.300
They stop near the sea.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:01.300
More penguins bring more berries.

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:09.300
Let's share.
